oup}body.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox-table th,body.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox-table td{padding-left:inherit;padding-right:inherit}}</style><table class=\"infobox hrecipe adr\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-above\">法式濃湯</th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-image\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Lobster_bisque.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/89/Lobster_bisque.jpg/250px-Lobster_bisque.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"166\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/89/Lobster_bisque.jpg/500px-Lobster_bisque.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1760\" data-file-height=\"1168\" /></a></span><div class=\"infobox-caption\" style=\"padding-bottom:0.25em;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa;\">一碗<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%BE%8D%E8%9D%A6%E6%BF%83%E6%B9%AF\" title=\"龍蝦濃湯\">龍蝦濃湯</a></div></td></tr><tr class=\"note\"><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"padding-top:0.245em;line-height:1.15em; padding-right:0.65em; white-space:nowrap;;\">別稱</th><td class=\"infobox-data\" style=\"\"><i>Bisque</i></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"padding-top:0.245em;line-height:1.15em; padding-right:0.65em; white-space:nowrap;;\">類型</th><td class=\"infobox-data\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B9%AF\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"湯\">湯</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"padding-top:0.245em;line-height:1.15em; padding-right:0.65em; white-space:nowrap;;\">起源地</th><td class=\"infobox-data region\" style=\"\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c3/Flag_of_France.svg/40px-Flag_of_France.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"22\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c3/Flag_of_France.svg/60px-Flag_of_France.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"900\" data-file-height=\"600\" /></span></span>&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B3%95%E5%9B%BD\" title=\"法國\">法國</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"padding-top:0.245em;line-height:1.15em; padding-right:0.65em; white-space:nowrap;;\">主要成分</th><td class=\"infobox-data ingredient\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%94%B2%E5%A3%B3%E5%8A%A8%E7%89%A9\" title=\"甲殼動物\">甲殼動物</a>（<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B5%B7%E8%9E%AF%E8%9D%A6%E7%A7%91\" title=\"海螯蝦科\">海螯蝦</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%8C%AA%E5%A8%81%E6%B5%B7%E8%9E%AF%E8%9D%A6\" title=\"挪威海螯蝦\">挪威海螯蝦</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%9F%B9%E8%82%89\" title=\"蟹肉\">蟹</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%9D%A6%E4%BB%81\" title=\"蝦仁\">蝦</a>或<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%9E%AF%E8%99%BE\" title=\"螯蝦\">螯蝦</a>）、<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A8%BB\" class=\"mw-disambig\" title=\"稻\">稻米</a></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>法式濃湯</b>（法語：<span lang=\"fr\">Bisque</span>，<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r88674605\">.mw-parser-output .IPA-label-small{font-size:85%}.mw-parser-output .references .IPA-label-small,.mw-parser-output .infobox .IPA-label-small,.mw-parser-output .navbox .IPA-label-small{font-size:100%}</style><span class=\"IPA-label IPA-label-small\">發音：</span><span class=\"IPA nowrap\" lang=\"fr-Latn-fonipa\"><a href=\"/wiki/Help:%E6%B3%95%E8%AA%9E%E5%9C%8B%E9%9A%9B%E9%9F%B3%E6%A8%99\" title=\"Help:法語國際音標\">&#91;bisk&#93;</a></span> <span class=\"unicode haudio\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"ext-phonos\"><span data-nosnippet=\"\" id=\"ooui-php-1\" class=\"noexcerpt ext-phonos-PhonosButton ext-phonos-PhonosButton-emptylabel oo-ui-widget oo-ui-widget-enabled oo-ui-buttonElement oo-ui-buttonElement-frameless oo-ui-buttonElement-size-medium oo-ui-iconElement oo-ui-buttonWidget\" data-ooui=\"{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;mw.Phonos.PhonosButton&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;\\/\\/upload.wikimedia.org\\/wikipedia\\/commons\\/transcoded\\/b\\/bc\\/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-bisque.wav\\/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-bisque.wav.mp3&quot;,&quot;rel&quot;:[&quot;nofollow&quot;],&quot;framed&quot;:false,&quot;icon&quot;:&quot;volumeUp&quot;,&quot;data&quot;:{&quot;ipa&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;lang&quot;:&quot;zh&quot;,&quot;wikibase&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;file&quot;:&quot;LL-Q150 (fra)-LoquaxFR-bisque.wav&quot;},&quot;classes&quot;:[&quot;noexcerpt&quot;,&quot;ext-phonos-PhonosButton&quot;,&quot;ext-phonos-PhonosButton-emptylabel&quot;]}\"><a role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/bc/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-bisque.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-bisque.wav.mp3\" rel=\"nofollow\" aria-label=\"播放音訊\" title=\"播放音訊\" class=\"oo-ui-buttonElement-button\"><span class=\"oo-ui-iconElement-icon oo-ui-icon-volumeUp\"></span><span class=\"oo-ui-labelElement-label\"></span><span class=\"oo-ui-indicatorElement-indicator oo-ui-indicatorElement-noIndicator\"></span></a></span><sup class=\"ext-phonos-attribution noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:LL-Q150_(fra)-LoquaxFR-bisque.wav\" title=\"File:LL-Q150 (fra)-LoquaxFR-bisque.wav\">ⓘ</a></sup></span></span></span>）是一種源於<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B3%95%E5%9C%8B\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"法國\">法國</a>的海鮮濃湯，傳統上以<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%94%B2%E6%AE%BC%E9%A1%9E\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"甲殼類\">甲殼類</a>熬製的濃湯過濾而成<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>。其可用<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B5%B7%E8%9E%AF%E8%9D%A6%E7%A7%91\" title=\"海螯蝦科\">海螯蝦</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%8C%AA%E5%A8%81%E6%B5%B7%E8%9E%AF%E8%9D%A6\" title=\"挪威海螯蝦\">挪威海螯蝦</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%9F%B9%E8%82%89\" title=\"蟹肉\">蟹</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%9D%A6%E4%BB%81\" title=\"蝦仁\">蝦</a>或<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%9E%AF%E8%99%BE\" title=\"螯蝦\">螯蝦</a>煮成。\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"語源\"><span id=\".E8.AA.9E.E6.BA.90\"></span>語源</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%B3%95%E5%BC%8F%E6%BF%83%E6%B9%AF&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節：語源\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Bay_of_Biscay_map.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/29/Bay_of_Biscay_map.svg/250px-Bay_of_Biscay_map.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"228\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/29/Bay_of_Biscay_map.svg/500px-Bay_of_Biscay_map.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1004\" data-file-height=\"916\" /></a><figcaption>比斯開灣位於法國海岸附近 </figcaption></figure><p>有關法式濃湯的名稱原意，有以下兩個解釋：\n</p><ol><li>「Bisque」源自<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B3%95%E5%9C%8B\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"法國\">法國</a>和<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A5%BF%E7%8F%AD%E7%89%99\" title=\"西班牙\">西班牙</a>之間的<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%AF%94%E6%96%AF%E9%96%8B%E7%81%A3\" title=\"比斯開灣\">比斯開灣</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>。</li>\n<li>「Bisque」是「煮兩次」（<i>bis cuites</i>）的誤傳。因為西歐人煮海鮮菜，習慣上會煮兩次：第一次把海鮮脫水，然後再用葡萄酒及香料等醃製海鮮，然後再煮第二次<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>。</li>\n<li>「Bisque」源自於諾曼語，意為「酸飲料」。<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li></ol>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"處理方法\"><span id=\".E8.99.95.E7.90.86.E6.96.B9.E6.B3.95\"></span>處理方法</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%B3%95%E5%BC%8F%E6%BF%83%E6%B9%AF&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"編輯章節：處理方法\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>法式濃湯被認為是一種處理賣相不夠好的甲殼類的好方法，因為能夠把甲殼類的所有精華都抽取出來。正宗的法式濃湯，會連甲殼都研磨成粉，再加進湯裡作<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A2%9E%E7%A8%A0%E5%8A%91\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"增稠劑\">增稠劑</a>之用。<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8C%B1%E8%8E%89%E4%BA%9E%C2%B7%E6%9F%B4%E7%88%BE%E5%BE%B7\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"茱莉亞·柴爾德\">茱莉亞·柴爾德</a>甚至在她講述烹調法國菜的書本中這麼寫<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>：\n</p>\n<table class=\"cquote pullquote\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"margin:auto; display:table; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; background-color: transparent; color: inherit;width: auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"skin-invert\" style=\"width: 20px; vertical-align: top; border: none; color: #B2B7F2; font-size: 40px; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;, Times, serif; font-weight: bold; line-height: .6em; text-align: left; padding: 10px; text-orientation: upright\">“\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; border: none; padding: 4px 10px;\">在湯未煮好之前，千萬別清洗任何東西，因為你會不斷使用同一個鍋來煮，而你肯定不會想把任何味道沖到下水渠去。\n</td>\n<td class=\"skin-invert\" style=\"width: 20px; vertical-align: bottom; border: none; color: #B2B7F2; font-size: 40px; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;, Times, serif; font-weight: bold; line-height: .6em; text-align: right; padding: 10px; text-orientation: upright\">”\n</td></tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n<p>不過，現時煮法式濃湯，亦有使用<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%B1%B3%E6%BC%BF\" title=\"米漿\">米漿</a>來作增稠劑，以節省時間。\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"參考資料\"><span id=\".E5.8F.83.E8.80.83.E8.B3.87.E6.96.99\"></span>參考資料</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%B3%95%E5%BC%8F%E6%BF%83%E6%B9%AF&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"編輯章節：參考資料\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95310437\">.mw-parser-output .reflist{margin-bottom:0.5em;list-style-type:decimal}@media screen{.mw-parser-output .reflist{font-size:90%}}.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{font-size:100%;margin-bottom:0;list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns{margin-top:0.3em}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns ol{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns li{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-alpha{list-style-type:upper-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-roman{list-style-type:upper-roman}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-alpha{list-style-type:lower-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-greek{list-style-type:lower-greek}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-roman{list-style-type:lower-roman}</style><div class=\"reflist\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">The Académie Française Dictionary defines a bisque as: BISQUE n. Potage fait d'un coulis de crustacés. Une bisque de homard, d'écrevisses. (Soup made from a crustacean coulis, e.g. lobster or crawfish bisque.)</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95173179\">.mw-parser-output cite